<title>GERMANY: Buba sets Nov minimum reserve at 38.1 bln mark.</title>
<headline>Buba sets Nov minimum reserve at 38.1 bln mark.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank on Monday said it has set the minimum reserve level for deposits for November at 38.1 billion marks.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
